<aside class="tc-message-box">

Most API documentation was written during development by AI. While it is accurate, and the data model and API it describes was designed with intention, it can be difficult to read with the hallmarks of AI writing. I plan to humanise it over time.

</aside>

The HyperGSD API gives plugin and content authors a way to integrate with the HyperGSD, without editing shadow tiddlers.

HyperGSD generally uses ''tags'' beginning with `$:/GSD/` to represent types and realms. An exception is the `GSD/Contexts` tag (the dashboard tiddler), which is tagged on all [[HyperGSD Contexts|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contexts]].

